@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@inviteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Resolve the recipient for a valid invite code (no-store response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/invite-details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "postern_invite_replace-with-code"
}

### Register using the email bound to the invite (registration does not accept an email override)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "replace-with-a-long-password",
  "inviteCode": "postern_invite_replace-with-code"
}

### Publicly request an invite (no email is sent until approval)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invite-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.test"
}

### List pending requests (requires admin session cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/invite-requests
Cookie: Postern.Auth={{adminSessionCookie}}

### Approve request and queue branded Resend email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/invite-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Cookie: Postern.Auth={{adminSessionCookie}}

### Reject request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/invite-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Cookie: Postern.Auth={{adminSessionCookie}}

### Resend invite (rotates the code and seven-day expiry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/invites/{{inviteId}}/resend
Cookie: Postern.Auth={{adminSessionCookie}}

### Revoke invite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/invites/{{inviteId}}/revoke
Cookie: Postern.Auth={{adminSessionCookie}}

### Resend webhook - use Resend's configured signed webhook, not a manual request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/resend
Content-Type: application/json
svix-id: {{resendEventId}}
svix-timestamp: {{resendTimestamp}}
svix-signature: {{resendSignature}}

{
  "type": "email.delivered",
  "data": {
    "email_id": "resend-message-id"
  }
}
